  description: '2+ monsters with different names

    If this card is Link Summoned:
    You can discard 1 card, then target 1 card on the field; shuffle it into the
    Deck, then, if this card was co-linked when this effect was activated, you can
    draw 1 card. You can only use this effect of "Knightmare Unicorn" once per turn.
    While any co-linked "Knightmare" monsters are on the field, for your normal draw
    in your Draw Phase, draw 1 card for each different card name among those co-linked
    "Knightmare" monsters, instead of drawing just 1 card.'
